    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Summoner class archetype.</em> A summoner whose eidolon is a Stand: a visible spirit of your own will with one unique power. Pick this class instead of Summoner. At 1st level you choose your stand type and Stand Ability, then the stand builder makes your stand. You don't get an eidolon, summoner spellcasting, a spell repertoire, signature spells or Instant Manifestation; everything else is the summoner's.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e-stand-class-archetype.stand-features.Item.bEf4g5COTKF0a5Kr]{Stand User}</p>",
